.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ev OPENAI_API_KEY
The OpenAI key, for
.Li llmBackend: openai
and the probe subcommands. Takes precedence over
.Li llmApiKey
in the configuration file.
.It Ev OPENAI_MEMORY_API_KEY
A separate key for the nightly memory job, billed to its own project.
.It Ev CREATURE_SERVER_HOST , Ev CREATURE_SERVER_PORT
Passed by the units to
.Fl -host
and
.Fl -port .
.It Ev STATE_DIRECTORY
Set by systemd; where the mind keeps its place in the World's history.
.It Ev OTEL_*
OpenTelemetry export (OTEL_SERVICE_NAME, OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT, OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_HEADERS,
OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_PROTOCOL).
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa /etc/creature/agent/ Ns Ar instance Ns Pa .yaml
One mind per character: the configuration for
.Li creature-agent@ Ns Ar instance ,
such as
.Li creature-agent@beaky .
.It Pa /etc/creature/agent.yaml
The configuration for the single
.Li creature-agent
unit.
.It Pa /etc/creature/agent/personas/
Each character's persona. Conffiles; an edited bird is never overwritten by an upgrade.
.It Pa /etc/default/creature-agent , Pa /etc/default/creature-agent- Ns Ar instance
Environment, shared then per mind, mode 0600. Keys live here and never in the YAML.
.It Pa /var/lib/creature-agent/ Ns Ar instance Ns Pa /
The mind's state: its World cursor, pending memory work and memory nights.
.It Pa /usr/lib/systemd/system/creature-agent@.service , Pa /usr/lib/systemd/system/creature-agent.service
The units. They run as a
.Li DynamicUser ;
upgrades restart every running mind.
.It Pa /usr/share/doc/creature-agent/creature-agent-manual.md
The operator's manual, including every configuration key.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
Start Beaky's mind:
.Dl systemctl enable --now creature-agent@beaky
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr creature-world 8
